    "title": "Pumpjack added to Alvin Museum's outdoor decor - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Alvin Sun Advertiser\nwebsite\nAlvin\nPumpjack added to Alvin Museum's outdoor decor\n6 hours ago\nTwo area men, Jerry Krampota and Dan Sebesta from Iowa Colony knew of a pumpjack in an area that was within the boundaries of a future subdivision and contacted the land developer and asked if he would be willing to donate it to the Alvin Historical Museum. The developer, Hines Land Development, agreed and the two men began to work towards having it restored and moved to the Museum.\n1",
